WEBVTT

00:00:00.790 --> 00:00:04.280
After all that, I think you know 
what I'm going to say.

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:07.750
Because I already know what it is!

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:11.520
Yes, your trump card is...

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.190
Super Polymerization!

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:22.500
Bull's-eye, right?

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:25.590
Dad!

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.740
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:34.410
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:00:35.270 --> 00:00:38.320
Their dragons call to each other,

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:41.590
almost as if seeking one another.

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:19.990
The Dazzling Entertainment Show

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:25.490
As I foresaw, I perfectly guessed your 
trump card, Super Polymerization.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.320
Now, in accordance with spell 
card Clairvoyance's effect,

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:31.500
please return it to your deck.

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:38.900
Then I draw two cards, set one, 
and end my turn.

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:43.110
This ends my entertainment duel's first act.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:46.360
Well? Did you enjoy it?

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:55.590
Nice one! Very interesting!

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:58.040
You are amazing, old man!

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:00.630
I tried to ignore you at first,

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:03.660
but I am so glad I dueled you!

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:07.830
Because I have never dueled anyone 
who has given me such enjoyment...

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:10.170
No, not even Hugo.

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:16.730
Please allow me to thank you, in my own way.

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:18.080
My turn!

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:22.180
I activate Predaplant Lilizard from my hand.

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:27.850
I activate my Continuous Spell Rapid Seed Fire.

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:32.940
I send the Predaplant Cordyceps, which is Level 4 
or below, from my deck to my graveyard.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:37.880
By doing this, I can deal 300 
points of damage to you,

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:41.800
and reduce the attack points of 
one of your monsters by 600.

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:45.640
I activate Sky Magician's monster effect!

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:48.380
When a spell or trap card is activated,

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:51.740
I can return one Continuous Spell 
from my field to my hand,

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:54.610
and activate another Continuous 
Spell from my hand!

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:57.750
I return Magician's Left Hand to my hand,

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:00.150
to activate Magician's Right Hand!

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:02.550
Magician's Right Hand?

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:06.960
Magician's Right Hand destroys spell cards!

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:15.870
And by activating a Continuous Spell 
on his side of the field,

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:19.400
Sky Magician's attack points 
go up by another 300!

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:25.180
He's back... That is our Yuya.

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:29.120
When Rapid Seed Fire is destroyed,

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:34.620
for each Predaplant I have on the field, 
I can destroy one of your cards.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:38.360
I choose to destroy Sky Magician 
and Magician's Right Hand.

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:42.060
I activate my trap Performapal Sky Ring!

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:46.140
When a Performapal Spellcaster 
is on my side of the field,

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.030
my cards cannot be destroyed!

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:52.200
Yes! He blocked that, too!

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:54.170
You're coming up short, old man.

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:59.140
I activate Continuous Spell Ivy 
Bind Castle from my hand.

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:11.760
Dad!

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:20.470
Now, the effects of all cards on your 
side of the field are negated.

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:22.570
All cards?

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:23.900
Yes.

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:27.010
Monster effects, spells, and traps!

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:28.970
Oh, no...

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:31.210
And not only that.

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:36.280
As long as this Continuous Spell is 
active, your monsters cannot attack.

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:40.460
And for each monster on the field 
when your turn comes around,

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:43.750
you take 800 points of damage.

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:46.190
You...

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:49.180
Indeed, you've tied my hands.

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:51.030
Or so it seems.

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:53.000
D-Dad?

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:58.500
In your present state, you still believe your 
entertainment can accomplish something?

00:05:58.930 --> 00:06:01.370
I won't know until I try.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:03.640
Then, go ahead and try.

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:05.340
I now end my turn.

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:08.350
I have prepared a fine stage for you,

00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:10.680
so do bring even more fun than before.

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:14.890
Now, the entertainment duel's second act begins!

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:17.780
No need to worry.

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:20.860
Knowing my dad, he will...

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:22.780
He's talking to someone.

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:26.090
Probably the Ute in his mind.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:31.540
If so, that means the darkness 
hasn't swallowed Ute yet.

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:34.260
Actually, this has happened before.

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:35.550
Before?

00:06:35.550 --> 00:06:36.240
Yeah.

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:41.820
Back when Mom first started taking 
me to the duel stadium...

00:06:57.490 --> 00:06:58.460
Dad!

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:01.020
No need to worry.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:04.700
He'll be fine. Knowing your dad, he will...

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.140
So it'll be fine this time, too.

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:10.340
Dad will...

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:15.250
Then, as you wish, we'll enter the 
entertainment duel's second act.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:18.820
Sky Magician's big escape show!

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:21.180
Yay! I've been waiting!

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:24.020
If it escapes, you'll get fabulous applause!

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:25.190
That's right!

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.240
Go, Sky Magician!

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:28.490
My turn!

00:07:28.490 --> 00:07:32.460
In that instant, you take 800 damage!

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:41.810
As long as Ivy Bind Castle is active,

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:47.810
when my turn comes around, I take 800 
damage for each monster on my field.

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:51.520
You even use my effect damage in your show?

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:53.120
That's right!

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:57.590
And while I was talking, Sky Magician 
succeeded in his escape.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:03.290
Impossible!

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:07.030
It's just the same! It really is just like that time...

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.910
How on earth...

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:31.560
When Sky Magician leaves the field, 
I can destroy one spell card.

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:36.230
Naturally, I destroy Ivy Bind Castle!

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:43.700
What's that?

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:47.670
Sky Magician's apprentice, 
Performapal Sky Pupil!

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:49.410
Apprentice?

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:53.510
The big escape show is done through their bond!

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:57.510
Using the effect of Sky Pupil in my hand,

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:00.590
I returned Sky Magician to my hand.

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:04.320
And in exchange, I Special Summoned Sky Pupil!

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:07.790
See?

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:11.860
See? I told you your father would be fine.

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:13.830
Dad!

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:23.210
This ends our big escape show.

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:25.140
Damn!

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:28.380
But the fun is only getting started!

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:32.500
I activate Continuous Spell Magician's 
Restage from my hand.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:37.340
When there's only one Spellcaster 
monster on my side of the field,

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:42.350
I can Special Summon one Spellcaster, 
of Level 3 or below.

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:46.280
I return Performapal Revue Dancer!

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:52.080
One Revue Dancer counts as two tributes.

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:57.130
I tribute Revue Dancer to Tribute 
Summon Sky Magician!

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:04.720
Now, teacher and pupil will work together!

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:09.890
Please watch this beautiful dance 
by Sky Magician and Sky Pupil!

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:15.090
I activate Magician's Right Hand!

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:19.300
In that instant, Sky Magician's 
attack points go up by 300!

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:20.800
Battle!

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:22.460
Go, Sky Magician!

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:25.380
Attack Lilizard!

00:10:30.510 --> 00:10:33.390
Follow your master, Sky Pupil!

00:10:33.390 --> 00:10:35.480
Attack Cephalotusnail!

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:39.280
In that instant, since Sky Magician is on the field,

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:42.170
Sky Pupil's attack points double!

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:45.820
Even if you increase its attack points,

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:48.430
Cephalotusnail cannot be destroyed by battle!

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:53.400
When Sky Pupil attacks, Sky Magician's presence

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:56.220
negates the effect of the monster it's fighting!

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:56.800
What?

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:03.450
I set one card and end my turn!

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:09.350
This concludes the entertainment 
duel's second act.

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:12.280
This is...

00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:15.160
Yeah... This is Dad's way of dueling!

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:23.460
At first, I found it a bit interesting.

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:25.960
But I am beginning to get annoyed.

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:33.020
That's sad. I was hoping I 
could make you smile, too.

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:34.590
Well, you did.

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:37.560
Because I know, in the end, I will still win.

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:38.810
My turn!

00:11:41.640 --> 00:11:43.580
See? It's here.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:45.550
I really am good on the draw.

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.290
What could it be?

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:49.420
It's a bluff.

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:52.020
Dad won't lose to someone like him!

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:56.130
Oh? Did you not want to be one with me?

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:58.600
No way! Never!

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:00.800
I'll never let that happen!

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:04.270
Oh, dear... But no need to worry.

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:07.240
Soon enough, you will lose 
your mind again for me.

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:09.470
And then, we will become one.

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:11.210
Just as Hugo did.

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:12.910
Hugo?

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:16.570
Yes, he is right here.

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:20.380
Turning out this way is our destiny, after all.

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:22.080
There is no destiny!

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:24.590
The future is something we make, 
with our own hands!

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:28.560
Oh? That doesn't sound like the one 
predicting the future before.

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:31.560
But the truth is that you were wrong then.

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:33.260
Wrong?

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:38.970
Yes, because my trump card isn't 
actually Super Polymerization!

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:40.960
Another bluff!

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:42.070
Honest...

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.870
I am about to show you.

00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:47.040
But first,

00:12:47.420 --> 00:12:51.020
I activate the effect of Cordyceps 
in my graveyard.

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:54.650
I banish this card, to Special 
Summon two Predaplants,

00:12:54.650 --> 00:12:57.490
of Level 4 or below, from my graveyard.

00:12:58.390 --> 00:13:02.190
I choose Cephalotusnail and Lilizard.

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:10.870
When Lilizard is Special Summoned from 
my graveyard, I can draw one card.

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:13.100
Now, everyone watch!

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:15.610
This is my real trump card!

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:19.580
I activate my spell card Ultra Polymerization!

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:21.950
Ultra Polymerization?

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:24.730
Yes, I will show it to you.

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:27.920
My own style of entertainment duel, using this!

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:33.580
When there are two fusion-component 
monsters on my side of the field,

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:39.620
in exchange for 1000 life points, 
Ultra Polymerization's effect can fuse them.

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:44.100
Two beautiful flowers, which use alluring 
fragrance to attract insects.

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:48.110
Now become one, and from 
the hell of your petals,

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:50.040
birth a new terror.

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:52.240
Fusion Summon!

00:13:52.650 --> 00:13:55.900
Appear, poisonous dragon with hungry fangs,

00:13:56.430 --> 00:14:00.740
Level 8 Starving Venom Fusion Dragon!

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:09.910
And this is only the prologue.

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:13.530
Ultra Polymerization lets me Special 
Summon the component monster

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:17.030
just used from my graveyard, 
with attack points reduced to 0!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:24.000
When Lilizard is summoned from my graveyard,

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.480
I can draw one card.

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:31.790
And using Ultra Polymerization's effect,

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:34.320
Lilizard can be used as a Tuner Monster!

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:35.100
What?

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:36.150
A Tuner?

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:42.260
Let me demonstrate the fact that I am 
now one with Hugo, mind and body.

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:48.370
Level 3 Lilizard tunes Level 4 Cephalotusnail!

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:54.650
Flap your beautiful and heroic wings,

00:14:54.650 --> 00:14:56.970
to strike the enemy at the speed of light!

00:14:57.740 --> 00:14:59.210
Synchro Summon!

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:04.320
Appear, Level 7 Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:18.860
Yuya!

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:22.830
I activate my Continuous Trap Sky Illusion!

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:25.100
As long as this card is on the field,

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:28.570
your monsters can attack no card but Sky Magician!

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:32.540
And Sky Magician cannot be 
destroyed by battle or effects!

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:35.010
I'm afraid your desperation move will not suffice.

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:40.950
I activate Starving Venom Fusion Dragon's 
effect, targeting Sky Magician.

00:15:42.490 --> 00:15:45.640
It negates Sky Magician's effect,

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:47.700
stealing it for itself.

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:50.660
But that alone would be boring.

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:53.860
My entertainment will exceed your expectations!

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:59.110
I activate Clear Wing Synchro Dragon's effect!

00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:05.040
I destroy Starving Venom Fusion Dragon, 
which has just activated its effect,

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:08.710
and add its attack points to those of 
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon.

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:11.420
What? That's his own ace monster...

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:12.180
He's destroying it?

00:16:22.760 --> 00:16:24.920
5300 attack points?

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:29.020
If he attacks with that, even if Sky 
Magician can't be destroyed,

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:30.670
Yusyo will still take 2300 damage!

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:33.140
But as I said, that's boring.

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:36.780
You need to enjoy my entertainment even more.

00:16:37.170 --> 00:16:38.610
Or rather, I do!

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:43.580
I pay your Magician's Right Hand 
and Left Hand as a cost,

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:49.050
to activate Destruction Flower and 
Destruction Fruit in my hand!

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:53.360
The effect of Destruction Fruit

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:56.890
reduces Clear Wing Synchro Dragon's 
attack points by 3000

00:16:57.210 --> 00:17:01.460
and Special Summons Starving Venom 
Fusion Dragon from my graveyard.

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:12.540
When a monster is Special Summoned 
from my graveyard,

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:14.480
I can activate Destruction Flower's effect!

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:17.950
I choose Clear Wing Synchro Dragon, 
whose attack points just decreased.

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:23.230
It deals you damage equal to the difference between 
its original and current attack points,

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:25.460
while reducing Sky Magician's attack 
points by the same amount!

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:31.900
Are you thinking, "It's only 200"?

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:36.720
But my true entertainment has only begun,

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:39.600
though it might be living hell for you.

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:41.570
Living hell?

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:45.780
I activate Starving Venom's effect, 
targeting Sky Magician.

00:17:46.770 --> 00:17:51.900
And Clear Wing's effect negates it 
and destroys Starving Venom!

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:57.960
Clear Wing's attack points increase 
by those of Starving Venom.

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:04.130
But Destruction Fruit's effect then decrease 
those attack points by 3000.

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:07.830
And I can Special Summon Starving 
Venom from my graveyard again!

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:18.380
In that instant, I activate Destruction 
Flower's effect, targeting Clear Wing!

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:23.770
I deal you 400 damage, the difference between 
its original and current attack points.

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:27.030
And Sky Magician's attack points 
decrease by another 400!

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:32.510
This time, it's 400!

00:18:32.510 --> 00:18:33.660
You mean this is...

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:36.220
Indeed, it will not end.

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:38.230
Not until your life has run out!

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:43.430
Since the damage increases by 
200 each time, this is 600.

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:47.400
Assuming your will holds out that long.

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:53.420
Stop it... Stop it!

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:57.050
Oh, good. I finally have your attention again.

00:18:57.400 --> 00:19:02.020
The more I make your father suffer, 
the more you look at me.

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:05.310
Now, continue, my entertainment!

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:06.730
Third hit!

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:11.660
Send the third one... Send Rin inside!

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:20.770
Ray will soon be revived.

00:19:21.060 --> 00:19:24.110
Until then, find a way to hold out, Yusyo.

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:32.920
Stop it...

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:35.150
Stop it!

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:38.390
Stop it...

00:19:38.680 --> 00:19:40.470
S-Stay back...

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:42.280
Stay back!

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:43.190
Fifth hit!

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:53.950
I can't watch this anymore!

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:54.810
Brother!

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:56.540
Don't interfere!

00:19:57.610 --> 00:19:59.280
But at this rate...

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:01.100
I know.

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:05.020
Even if I keep fighting, I can't possibly win...

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:07.210
Then, why do you continue?

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:08.920
You could simply surrender.

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:14.000
Even if I can't win, on my pride 
as an entertainer,

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:15.890
I will remain on the stage.

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:20.330
So that the sight of me will be burned 
into my son's... into Yuya's heart!

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:22.030
Mr. Sakaki...

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:27.450
Yuya... My son...

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:29.100
He will never—

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:30.170
Shut up!

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:33.380
No matter what you do, he belongs to me!

00:20:33.890 --> 00:20:35.580
I won't let anyone else have him!

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:39.050
I guess I had better give you a flashy send-off...

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:42.380
Starving Venom Fusion Dragon,

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:44.260
attack Sky Magician!

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:07.140
Dad...

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:11.190
Smiles, Yuya.

00:23:49.040 --> 00:23:50.710
You'll pay...

00:23:50.710 --> 00:23:52.990
For turning my father into a card...

00:23:52.990 --> 00:23:54.890
Give him back!

00:23:55.350 --> 00:23:57.380
You want this card, do you?

00:23:57.380 --> 00:24:01.220
Then fight me... in a duel!

00:24:01.640 --> 00:24:04.990
As long as Dad is watching 
over me, I won't lose!

00:24:05.240 --> 00:24:08.220
Starving Venom wants a friend.

00:24:08.220 --> 00:24:11.500
Yes... Your dragon!

00:24:11.800 --> 00:24:15.530
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Allure of Darkness.

00:24:15.530 --> 00:24:17.700
The fun is only getting started!
